[node name="Office" type="Node3D"]
script = ExtResource("1_office")
room_id = &"office"
display_name = "Office"
floor_size = Vector2(2, 1.65)
max_stride_gain = 1.0
editor_description = "Office (owner: Dario). Layout from Sofia's lobby plan (Lobby-North-Doors, 25 Nov).
Origin = centre of the taped square, x east, north = -z.
Room: x -1.0 to +1.0, z -1.2 to +0.45 (2.0 x 1.65 m, gain 1.0). The lobby strip is south of z +0.45.
One lane, x -0.375 to +0.375, kept clear: Door_lobby (0, +0.45) -> ReturnPortal (0, -0.17) -> safe front (0, -0.8).
ReturnPortal: one-way, walk south through it -> lobby. Closed until open_return_portal() (after the pickup).
SafeSlot: the P2 safe, at the north end of the lane, facing south. Opening it opens the return portal
(stand-in until piece pickup exists). CodeClue: static code note above the desk (until the portal window).
Furniture only outside the lane: desk on the west wall, shelf on the east wall."

